  },
  "body": "MSAL's Instance Discovery is enabled by default but requires that the Authority Host is validatable via the public Microsoft Entra endpoint.\r\n\r\nThis commit introduces support for disabling Instance Discovery which allows for using Custom Authority Hosts as needed - which allows working with custom environments.\r\n\r\nThis functionality is both opt-in by the user and only supported when using a custom environment.\r\n\r\nFixes #265677",
  "rebaseable": true
 },
