   "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nAdds opt-in support for bypassing MSAL Instance Discovery for custom authority hosts.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds and documents the `instanceDiscovery` setting.\n- Configures MSAL `knownAuthorities` from the custom environment.\n- Logs fallback behavior for invalid authority URLs.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 3 out of 3 changed files in this pull request and generated 3 comments.\n\n| File | Description |\n| ---- | ----------- |\n| `cachedPublicClientApplication.ts` | Applies the custom authority to MSAL configuration. |\n| `package.json` | Contributes the new boolean setting. |\n| `package.nls.json` | Adds the localized setting description. |\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/microsoft/vscode/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
