    "message": "`microsoft-authentication`: only trust custom authorities for custom environments\n\nDerive the known authorities from the PCA's own environment rather than the\n`microsoft-sovereign-cloud.customEnvironment` setting, so the public `microsoft`\nprovider (and built-in sovereign clouds) keep Instance Discovery, and recreate\nthe sovereign cloud provider when `instanceDiscovery` changes so it takes effect\nwithout a reload.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
